            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_47ec2bd09f33"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Harborlight enrolled 1,148 adult learners in FY2026, up from 936, and 71 learners earned a high school equivalency credential.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Who we served”",
            "source_id": "s_4e667e562e8b"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Operating expenses were $1,420,000, and 287 adults were still on the waitlist at year end.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_4e667e562e8b"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“The waitlist”",
            "source_id": "s_4e667e562e8b"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Staff recommend a $1,610,000 FY2027 budget that adds a sixth site at the Eastgate branch library and two site coordinators.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Recommendation to the board”",
            "source_id": "s_4e667e562e8b"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Reserves stand at 3.2 months of operating expenses, below the board's 4-month target, and the board will vote on October 21.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_47ec2bd09f33"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
